# Physical mods (lctl) - obsidian (actions/obsidian/obsidian_physical_mods.kbd)
**lctl + b**        -- Page Up
**lctl + f**        -- Page Down
**lctl + t**        -- Tabs New
**lctl + ,**        -- Setting
**lctl + ;**        -- Vimola
**lctl + [**        -- Forward
**lctl + ]**        -- Backward
**lctl + lsft + t** -- Tabs Undo Close
